## 1. Handler 매핑 조회 

![](https://velog.velcdn.com/images/trendsetter/post/322fc927-b449-426f-a0db-4186bd5025eb/image.png)

## 2. HandlerAdapter  조회 
```java
MyHandlerAdapter adapter = getHandlerAdapter(handler);
```
로 해당 핸들러(`MemberFormControllerV4`)를 처리 가능한 핸들러어댑터를 조회한다.

```java
private MyHandlerAdapter getHandlerAdapter(Object handler) {
        MyHandlerAdapter a;
        for (MyHandlerAdapter adapter : handlerAdapters) {
            if(adapter.support(handler)){
                return adapter;
            }

        }
        throw new IllegalArgumentException("Can't fond handler adapter.handler adapter= " + handler);
    }
```
